WEBVTT

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:02.263
Where do amino acids get linked together?

00:00:02.890 --> 00:00:03.784
At the P site.

00:00:04.318 --> 00:00:06.234
The tRNA in the P site holds

00:00:06.280 --> 00:00:06.861
the chain.

00:00:07.395 --> 00:00:08.985
A new tRNA waits in the A

00:00:09.101 --> 00:00:10.576
site with its amino acid.

00:00:11.203 --> 00:00:11.679
Snap.

00:00:12.073 --> 00:00:14.012
A peptide bond links the two amino

00:00:14.082 --> 00:00:14.674
acids.

00:00:15.208 --> 00:00:16.926
That bond forms at the P site.

00:00:17.460 --> 00:00:19.132
Like adding a bead to a necklace.

00:00:19.759 --> 00:00:21.129
The peptide bond forms at the P

00:00:21.268 --> 00:00:21.640
site.

00:00:21.930 --> 00:00:22.580
Swipe.
